===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Any of the [[poisonous]] [[umbellifer]]ous [[plant]]s, of the genera
## ''[[Conium]]'', either ''[[Conium maculatum]]'' or {{taxlink|Conium chaerophylloides|species}}.
##* {{quote-book|en|year=1971|author=Richard Carpenter|authorlink=Richard Carpenter (screenwriter)|title=Catweazle and the Magic Zodiac|publisher=Puffin Books|location=Harmondsworth|page=41|text=There were bunches of wild garlic to keep out evil spirits, foxgloves for healing spells and '''hemlock''' and vervain for darker magic.}}
## ''[[Cicuta]]'', [[water hemlock]] plant.
# The [[poison]] obtained from these ''Conium'' and ''Cicuta'' plants. {{defdate|from c. 1600}}
# {{senseid|en|Tsuga}} Any of several [[coniferous]] [[tree]]s, of the genus ''[[Tsuga]]'', that grow in [[North America]]; the [[wood]] of such trees. {{defdate|from 1670}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2018|author={{w|Richard Powers}}| title={{w|The Overstory}}| publisher=Vintage (2019)| page=380| passage=The wind blows and the '''hemlocks''' wave their feathery leading shoots. Such a graceful profile, so elegant a tree.}}

